# Automation Artifacts

_This file is populated by IRIS as it learns the automation artifacts you have placed in `scripts/`. When you see this placeholder text, no artifacts have been learned yet._

To populate this file:

1. Drop an automation artifact into `~/iris/automation/scripts/`
2. Tell IRIS to learn it — or IRIS will notice it the next time it runs
3. IRIS will read the artifact, install any dependencies, summarize what it does, and append an entry here

Each entry in this file describes one artifact IRIS can use during ticket workflows.

